flowchart TB
    START["<b>Every failure must degrade into<br/>a VISIBLE GAP — never a silent wrong caption</b>"]
    START --> F

    F{"Failure"}

    F --> F1["<b>1 · No confidence available</b><br/>ADR-0002"]
    F1 --> F1R["Take ladder rung 3 (segment proxy)<br/>or SNR-gated certainty.<br/><b>Design-level — decide by T+3, stop at T+5</b>"]

    F --> F2["<b>2 · WebGPU absent</b>"]
    F2 --> F2R["WASM path, pre-warmed cache<br/><i>Latency only — covered</i>"]

    F --> F3["<b>3 · Model download incomplete</b>"]
    F3 --> F3R["Fixture mode + explicit warning<br/><i>Demo only, if pre-downloaded</i>"]

    F --> F4["<b>4 · Hallucination loop on noise</b>"]
    F4 --> F4R["Repetition detector → emit<br/>repetition_suppressed gap<br/><i>One segment — contained by design</i>"]

    F --> F5["<b>5 · Phone thermal throttling</b>"]
    F5 --> F5R["Shrink model, warn, suggest pause<br/><i>Latency. Coverage drops honestly</i>"]

    F --> F6["<b>6 · Battery dies mid-class</b>"]
    F6 --> F6R["Segments checkpointed on write<br/>→ partial lesson recoverable<br/><i>Only because of incremental writes</i>"]

    F --> F7["<b>7 · Backgrounded tab throttles timers</b>"]
    F7 --> F7R["Warn: keep screen open<br/><i>Detection is cheap</i>"]

    F --> F8["<b>8 · IndexedDB quota exceeded</b>"]
    F8 --> F8R["Drop audio blobs, keep text, tell user<br/><i>Text survives</i>"]

    F --> F9["<b>9 · Mic permission denied</b>"]
    F9 --> F9R["Clear explanation, no silent dead UI<br/><i>Total, but visibly</i>"]

    F --> F10["<b>10 · Low-end device OOM</b>"]
    F10 --> F10R["Restart worker with smaller model<br/><i>Session text survives</i>"]

    F --> F11["<b>11 · Decoder hangs past timeout</b>"]
    F11 --> F11R["Per-segment timeout = 2× measured p95<br/>→ emit gap rather than block forever<br/><b>A stalled decoder is worse than an admitted gap</b>"]

    F1R --> T["<b>All paths converge on:<br/>an explicit, attributable Gap</b>"]
    F2R --> T
    F3R --> T
    F4R --> T
    F5R --> T
    F6R --> T
    F7R --> T
    F8R --> T
    F9R --> T
    F10R --> T
    F11R --> T

